# Communications lead

You own every message to staff and clients during the outage.

:::checklist
- [ ] Agree the first message with :contact[crisis-lead]
- [ ] Send it to all staff through Emaileri within 30 minutes
- [ ] Log each message and its time in the [DR playbook](../playbook.en.md) decision log
- [ ] Send an update at least every two hours
- [ ] Send the all-clear when the crisis lead declares the end
:::

:::callout
Keep messages short: what happened, what people should do, and when the next update comes.
:::
